 border-radius:6px; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold;\">           ⭐ Leave Us a Review         </a>       </div>        <p style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.7;\">         It only takes a minute, and your feedback makes a real difference         to our team.       </p>        <p style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.7;\">         Thank you again for choosing Construction. We hope you're         enjoying your newly completed project!       </p>        <p style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0;\">         Warm regards,<br>         <strong>The Construction Team</strong>       </p>      </div>      <!-- Footer -->     <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; padding:20px 35px; text-align:center; border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">       <p style=\"margin:0; color:#9ca3af; font-size:12px;\">         Thank you for choosing Construction.       </p>     </div>    </div> </div>",
